"index":{"EA20":0,"PT":1},"label":{"EA20":"Euro area – 20 countries (2023-2025)","PT":"Portugal"}}},"time":{"label":"Time","category":{"index":{"1996":0,"1997":1,"1998":2,"1999":3,"2000":4,"2001":5,"2002":6,"2003":7,"2004":8,"2005":9,"2006":10,"2007":11,"2008":12,"2009":13,"2010":14,"2011":15,"2012":16,"2013":17,"2014":18,"2015":19,"2016":20,"2017":21,"2018":22,"2019":23,"2020":24,"2021":25,"2022":26,"2023":27,"2024":28,"2025":29},"label":{"1996":"1996","1997":"1997","1998":"1998","1999":"1999","2000":"2000","2001":"2001","2002":"2002","2003":"2003","2004":"2004","2005":"2005","2006":"2006","2007":"2007","2008":"2008","2009":"2009","2010":"2010","2011":"2011","2012":"2012","2013":"2013","2014":"2014","2015":"2015","2016":"2016","2017":"2017","2018":"2018","2019":"2019","2020":"2020","2021":"2021","2022":"2022","2023":"2023","2024":"2024","2025":"2025"}}}},"extension":{"lang":"EN","description":"<p>The Harmonised Index of Consumer Prices (HICP) measures price changes of various consumer goods and services over time (inflation). This dataset&nbsp;comprises:&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><ul><li>the average index, which is the average of the monthly HICP indices in a calendar year, and&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li>the annual average rate of change, which is the average of the monthly consumer price indices over a calendar year compared to the average of the monthly consumer price indices over the previous calendar year</li></ul><p>Please note that this dataset is discontinued and replaced by <a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/bookmark/f7a8b7e0-9b0e-4652-a82b-ad4ffc058b1b?lang=en&amp;createdAt=2026-05-20T13:25:22Z\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">prc_hicp_ainr</a></p>","id":"PRC_HICP_AIND","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"1.0","datastructure":{"id":"PRC_HICP_AIND","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"59.0"},"annotation":[{"type":"CREATED","date":"2015-11-16T10:20:47+0100"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_DOI_XML","title":"<adms:identifier xmlns:adms=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#\" 